OL,3,AUK has 'no authority' over death of
OL,4,Awoman shot in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a British woman who was
OL,7,Fshot and killed by her father in Texas
OL,8,Fhas been told that police in the UK
OL,9,Fhave "no lawful authority to intervene"
OL,10,Fas the family tries to find answers.
OL,12,FLucy Harrison, 23, from Warrington was
OL,13,Fshot in the chest on 10 January 2025 in
OL,14,FProsper, Dallas - found by a UK coroner
OL,15,Fto be an unlawful killing.
OL,17,FHowever, no criminal case was brought
OL,18,Fagainst her father Kris Harrison, after
OL,19,Fa grand jury in Collin County declined
OL,20,Fto indict him.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
